	-- {area:35} Booty Bay · {area:976} Gadgetzan · {area:392} Ratchet · {area:2255} Everlook
	["Bloodsail standing goes up only by killing the people of {area:35}, and every kill costs you {area:35} 125 and the other goblin towns ({area:976}, {area:392}, {area:2255}, and in Forever likely Powderfuse) about 62 each. After the Bruisers this guide asks for, every goblin town is Hated: their guards attack you, and you lose their flight masters, inns, vendors and {area:976}'s and {area:2255}'s auction houses. Getting back takes longer than getting here (last step). Fly in, bind elsewhere, and do your goblin-town business first. The outfit and the hat need only Friendly; past that Bloodsail has nothing to give. {area:35}'s guards are not your enemies yet: tick At War for {area:35} in your reputation panel, then attack."] = "",

